    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 107.6,
    "endS": 119.7,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I think that was like the main theme was creativity involves, um, being kind to yourself, which I don't think is Talked about as much as it should be.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-10-04T21:14:46.985Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "83102339-bbca-433e-9681-baef23e67cc4",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 119.8,
    "endS": 130.5,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I think that there's a pressure to produce things. As a creative person, but not to be kind of kind to yourself about what the process is going to be like,",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-10-04T21:14:46.985Z"
  },
  {
